mission "The Cane Wharf Raid"
    name "The Cane Wharf Raid"
    description "Sink the three Company transports at Sugarhook Roads, then return to Sugarhook and meet the island council."
    source "Crown's Fall"
    destination "Sugarhook"
    reward 820
    objective kills 3
    battlefield "Sugarhook Roads" 15780.9 1448.1
    enemy "Sugarhook Roads Guard 1"
    enemy "Sugarhook Roads Guard 2"
    enemy "Sugarhook Roads Guard 3"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Notary of Crown's Fall: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Three Company vessels are loading chained labourers and seized cargo at Sugarhook Roads.`
            `The governor claims the workers are debtors. The manifests show that many were taken from fishing villages that refused to pay the new harbour taxes.`
            `The ships are guarded by hired marines. Stop the transfer before they clear the roads.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The ships are guarded by hired marines. Stop the transfer before they clear the roads.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Notary Bell sends a copy of the charter with you. “A paper trail is useful, captain, but sometimes a ship must be stopped before its cargo disappears.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Cane Wharf Raid. Sink the three Company transports at Sugarhook Roads, then return to Sugarhook and meet the island council."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The transports are destroyed and the prisoners are brought ashore. The island council gives you the names of the shipyard foremen at Port de Lune.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The Company has been converting merchant hulls into warships in secret.`
        log "Completed The Cane Wharf Raid. Received 820 gold. The Company has been converting merchant hulls into warships in secret."
